        "Content": "\nHallway - 1.89m x 4.64m\nWith laminate timber flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 3.68m x 5.12m\nBright Living Room with laminate timber flooring, cove cornicing and open plan to Kitchen / Dining Room.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.68m x 3.71m\nSpacious Kitchen / Dining Room with modernfitted Kitchen, open plan to Living Room, tiled flooring and access to rear yard.\n\nWC - 1.38m x 1.67m\nWith W.C, W.H.B and laminate timber flooring.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 2.06m x 3.44m\nWith access to attic and hotpress.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 2.95m x 4.37m\nLarge Master Bedroom with fitted wardrobes, En-Suite and laminate timber flooring.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.73m x 1.10m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, electric shower and tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.26m x 3.29m\nSpacious Bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.54m x 2.79m\nFront-facing Bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.30m x 2.07m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, bath and laminate timber flooring.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nGarage - 2.31m x 4.67m\nIdeal for storage.\n\n"
